  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Monitoring Nature resources 2017-19 Alb</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Uppf&#xf6;ljning Naturresurser 2017-19 Alb</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Monitoring support of two Projects within natural Resources (forests and water) plus an option for support to policy development in the water sector.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till uppf&#xf6;ljning av tv&#xe5; naturresursprojekt (vatten och skog) samt option f&#xf6;r st&#xf6;d till policyutveckling inom vattensektorn.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the assignment was to monitor and advise on the implementation of a number of Sida supported interventions in the forest and water sectors.
The assignment has been carried out in a very timely and professional and has been very useful to Sida&apos;s own follow-up of the projects and provided support in the dialogue with the Albanian partners and with the World Bank (the implementing partner). The expert has provided very useful support to the Albanian partners.</narrative>
  </description>
